                    It gives me immense pleasure to welcome you to Bharat Ratna Babasaheb Bhimrao Ambedkar Rajkiya Engineering College Pratapgarh. It is a state-funded government engineering institution established by the Government of Uttar Pradesh in the academic session 2023–24. The Institute has been functioning from its newly developed permanent campus since the academic session 2025–26.

                </p>
