                    The institute aims to serve students from Pratapgarh and surrounding districts, with special focus on those from economically weaker and socially disadvantaged sections of society. We believe that education serves as a vital pathway for social and economic mobility and sustainable development. It seeks to provide affordable, accessible, and high-quality technical education to deserving students who aspire to become engineers despite social or economic limitations.


                </p>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="row">
            <div class="col-sm-12">
                <p class="text-dark speak-text" style="font-size: 19px; line-height: 34px; text-align: justify; font-family: Arial; margin-left: 20px;">
